  "contract": "Flat packed UTF8 and one dictionary indirection compare valid scalar prefixes in UTF16 order, including supplementary characters. Probe starting positions are bounded to the first 16 bytes; a final scalar may read up to three more bytes. Malformed or unresolved long prefixes use the existing admitted scalar path. One explicitly admitted operation-local counter stops probes after eight consecutive unresolved non-null text comparisons; successful comparisons reset it. Nulls and unsupported shapes do not count as unsuccessful probes. Numeric-only and zero-capacity owned operations allocate no probe. No retained decoded keys.",
